msgid "Managed by %s"
msgstr "Wedi'i reoli gan %s"

msgid "Shut down"
msgstr "Diffodd"

msgid "Browse as Guest"
msgstr "Pori fel gwestai"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Apiau"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Diddymu"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "Ailgynnig"

msgid "Opening the sign-in page…"
msgstr "Yn agor y dudalen mewngofnodi…"

msgid "The sign-in page could not be opened."
msgstr "Doedd dim modd agor y dudalen mewngofnodi."

msgid "Cannot reach the school. Connect to Wi-Fi from the top bar, then retry."
msgstr "Methu cyrraedd yr ysgol. Cysylltwch â Wi-Fi o'r bar uchaf, yna ceisiwch eto."

msgid "Local manager"
msgstr "Gweinyddwr lleol"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Enw defnyddiwr"

msgid "This account cannot sign in on this computer."
msgstr "Does dim modd i'r cyfrif hwn fewngofnodi ar y cyfrifiadur hwn."

msgid "This account cannot sign in on this computer. Use your school email (%s)."
msgstr "Does dim modd i'r cyfrif hwn fewngofnodi ar y cyfrifiadur hwn. Defnyddiwch e-bost eich ysgol (%s)."

msgid "You signed in with a different account. Sign in again with the account you chose here."
msgstr "Rydych wedi mewngofnodi gyda chyfrif gwahanol. Mewngofnodwch eto gyda'r cyfrif a ddewisoch yma."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Iaith"

msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Bysellfwrdd"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Parhau"

msgid "The setting could not be saved. Try again."
msgstr "Doedd dim modd cadw'r gosodiad. Ceisiwch eto."

msgid "Your account is disabled. Contact your administrator."
msgstr "Mae eich cyfrif wedi'i analluogi. Cysylltwch â'ch gweinyddwr."

msgid "This device is disabled. Contact your administrator."
msgstr "Mae'r ddyfais hon wedi'i hanalluogi. Cysylltwch â'ch gweinyddwr."

msgid "Sign in with your school account."
msgstr "Mewngofnodwch gyda chyfrif eich ysgol."

msgid "Could not sign in. Please try again."
msgstr "Methu mewngofnodi. Ceisiwch eto."

msgid "Authentication request cancelled"
msgstr "Diddymwyd y cais dilysu"

msgid "Maximum number of authentication attempts reached"
msgstr "Cyrhaeddwyd uchafswm y ceisiadau dilysu"

msgid "Error retrieving access token. Please try again."
msgstr "Gwall wrth nôl y tocyn mynediad. Ceisiwch eto."

msgid "Invalid user name"
msgstr "Enw defnyddiwr annilys"

msgid "This computer has been locked by the school; please contact IT"
msgstr "Mae'r ysgol wedi cloi'r cyfrifiadur hwn; cysylltwch â TG"

msgid "Guest sign-in is not allowed on this computer"
msgstr "Ni chaniateir mewngofnodi fel gwestai ar y cyfrifiadur hwn"

msgid "Local accounts cannot sign in on this computer"
msgstr "Does dim modd i gyfrifon lleol fewngofnodi ar y cyfrifiadur hwn"

msgid "School accounts cannot sign in on this computer"
msgstr "Does dim modd i gyfrifon ysgol fewngofnodi ar y cyfrifiadur hwn"

msgid "This app can only be opened from the sign-in screen"
msgstr "Dim ond o'r sgrin mewngofnodi y mae modd agor yr ap hwn"

msgid "This app needs a network. Connect to Wi-Fi from the top bar, then retry."
msgstr "Mae'r ap hwn angen rhwydwaith. Cysylltwch â Wi-Fi o'r bar uchaf, yna ceisiwch eto."

msgid "No network. Choose a Wi-Fi network in the top-right menu, or plug in a network cable or a phone with USB tethering."
msgstr "Dim rhwydwaith. Dewiswch rwydwaith Wi-Fi yn y ddewislen ar y dde uchaf, neu plygiwch gebl rhwydwaith neu ffôn sy'n rhannu cysylltiad drwy USB."

msgid "Waiting for school settings."
msgstr "Yn aros am osodiadau'r ysgol."

msgid "Installing the web browser. You can sign in; it will appear when ready."
msgstr "Wrthi'n gosod y porwr gwe. Gallwch fewngofnodi; bydd yn ymddangos pan fydd yn barod."

msgid "The web browser could not be installed yet; it will try again. You can sign in."
msgstr "Doedd dim modd gosod y porwr gwe eto; bydd yn ceisio eto. Gallwch fewngofnodi."

msgid "Name or school email"
msgstr "Enw neu e-bost yr ysgol"

msgid "Keep typing to narrow down"
msgstr "Daliwch ati i deipio i gulhau'r rhestr"
